    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="446e8ccd-8d16-55c2-885c-7ac09303fb71" activityNameId="ec9884d2-58bb-5034-989c-140b1b353d26" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Wind power plant 600kW, fixed parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Wind power plant 600kW, fixed parts
Lifetime is assumed to be 40 years. Annual electricity production is assumed to be 736 MWh. Data are from a Nordex N43/600 plant. The foundation (concrete and reinforcing steel) is assumed to be remaining in the ground after the demolition of the power plant.;
UUID: f443602e-8634-378f-91d6-21e6151c9846
Includes materials used for fixed parts: tower and base, and their disposal. Also includes the prozessing, the transports needed, and the area that is needed for installation and the energy requirements for the installation itself.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average European technology of a 600 kW wind power plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f443602e-8634-378f-91d6-21e6151c9846.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
